OL,3,GNEWSAIceland to open first store in the
OL,4,AFalklands
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupermarket Iceland is opening its
OL,7,Ffirst branch in the Falkland Islands,
OL,8,Faccording to boss Lord Richard Walker.
OL,10,FHe said the store would be opening in
OL,11,FDecember, adding on LinkedIn it would
OL,12,Fbe the the first UK high street brand
OL,13,Fto open there.
OL,15,FThe shop will be in the capital Stanley
OL,16,Fwhere it will serve a population of
OL,17,Fabout 3,500.
OL,19,FLord Walker said the Welsh business,
OL,20,Fbased in Deeside, in Flintshire, was
OL,21,Fgrowing internationally and he wanted
OL,22,Fto expand it further.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
